  "title": "Rocky&#39;s Zesty Ham Croquettes",
  "description": "Rocky&#39;s zesty ham croquette recipe includes ham, dried onions, garlic, bread crumbs, and Cheddar cheese. They&#39;re lightly breaded and fried until golden.",
